"reason": "The person's words ask to fix nested operators (| and &) in the pipeline API. Paths: (1) nested OR `(a | b) | c` — expected to accept values matching any branch — exercised by `test_nested_operators` (nested OR section, validates 1, 7, 15 pass and 9 fails); (2) nested AND `(a & b) & c` — expected to require all conditions — exercised by `test_nested_operators` (nested AND section, validates 0 and 5 pass, 10/-1/25 fail); (3) mixed operators `(a | b) & c` — expected to combine union and chain correctly — exercised by `test_nested_operators` (mixed section, validates 1 and 20 pass, 3 and 10 fail). All nested-operator paths described by the intent have corresponding test assertions.",
